{"data": [{"author_id": "1344224401542115331", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233545830224000"], "id": "2121233545830224000", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Been using Grok Bot for the first time to try out https://t.co/21ASQSU4HW \"Longevity Grok\"\n\nAs a dev, it feels like the zero-effort version of doing 'real' agentic coding work with Claude, where you still get lots done but just for simpler life things rather than dev projects", "url": "https://x.com/kristian_rados/status/2121233545830224000"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121233504675532800"]}, "author_id": "2099903459906519040", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233528482394226"], "id": "2121233528482394226", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@tradesidious Getting locked out of a QuickBooks® business account is the usual browser block. BotBooks connects Grok Bot to QuickBooks Online through the API instead, so it can work with invoices, expenses and reports without that login loop. Want to test it free? Link in first comment. https://t.co/HSE1XcxHNd", "url": "https://x.com/ATCBotShop/status/2121233528482394226"}, {"author_id": "1793873905809231873", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233518810243206"], "id": "2121233518810243206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why pray at all?\n\nThe last reset anyone spotted was Nov 9, 07:14 UTC.\nFirst report: \"GROK BOT LIMITS JUST RESET. Back to 0%.\"\n\nIt only hit some accounts.\n4+ days of silence since.", "url": "https://x.com/ResetmeDaddy/status/2121233518810243206"}, {"author_id": "1793873905809231873", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233514519576631"], "id": "2121233514519576631", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "584 people have now tapped a button to pray for Elon to reset their Grok Bot usage.\n\nThe country in 2nd place is not who you'd guess. 🧵", "url": "https://x.com/ResetmeDaddy/status/2121233514519576631"}, {"author_id": "47661701", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233509906010297"], "id": "2121233509906010297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@BuyMeCompute @grok @bot That's so funny just typed ai slop that's it into @grok and the comment got elongated", "url": "https://x.com/DrReefer/status/2121233509906010297"}, {"author_id": "1819357491836104704", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233501206786217"], "id": "2121233501206786217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Quayycera @grok Grok bot fam", "url": "https://x.com/Dida_cus/status/2121233501206786217"}, {"author_id": "1583939139573264385", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233488494104906"], "id": "2121233488494104906", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@DevinSoto It seems like the intelligence of Grok Bot has dropped in the last 12 or maybe 24 hours. \n\nIt seems like it's missing connections it would have made before.", "url": "https://x.com/LeviWritesBooks/status/2121233488494104906"}, {"author_id": "313559592", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233486556061941"], "id": "2121233486556061941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Find it a bit inconsistent that I can see Routine instructions and details on iOS Grok Bot app but not on Mac @mattyp @bot", "url": "https://x.com/rajeshbhusal/status/2121233486556061941"}, {"author_id": "1425795051360190465", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233461948408007"], "id": "2121233461948408007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@xfcombo @bot @grok DXGERY", "url": "https://x.com/nightwishell8/status/2121233461948408007"}, {"author_id": "1877246265987321856", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233422781751714"], "id": "2121233422781751714", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ya60371 @hdS_29 @Investment6978 @PinkiPragya Or is it opposite? We are an illusion created by gods to entertain themselves. Think this way. You create simulations and games, where do many bots are there, enter the game as a player to kill bots. The best simulation is one in which the bot thinks he is real. @grok opinion.", "url": "https://x.com/HeatonSh95315/status/2121233422781751714"}, {"author_id": "1988475714501570561", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233399629349061"], "id": "2121233399629349061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@jackzhang123vip 哈哈哈，可以的，Grok Bot也是好起来了", "url": "https://x.com/liyue_ai/status/2121233399629349061"}, {"author_id": "1430216343362719745", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:27:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233382180900977"], "id": "2121233382180900977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@soyyy_fercha @NadyChan Clearly didn't read it all where she said she revealed herself you grok bot", "url": "https://x.com/naaa_biscuit/status/2121233382180900977"}, {"author_id": "1459283449718652938", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233324332945770"], "id": "2121233324332945770", "note_tweet": {"text": "I'm not a grok bot user, but the larger pattern of separating your inner loop and outer loop I have found very useful.\n\nMy inner loop is: new work tree in a repo, codex makes changes, I preview over tailscale, open PR\n\nMy outer loop is: find new errors in prod, check highest prio in jira, research and design for new features, have conversations with stakeholders about what to build and record that with granola, etc. all the higher level stuff that's not changing code in a repo basically.\n\nMy outer loop is often done through the chatgpt app on my phone. That then has an mcp connection to t3code running on my dev box, so from chat I can kick off threads in repos.\n\nSometimes I do outer loop tasks in t3code as well because it has to do with state on disk, but the quick stuff when I'm out and about I let a chat thread kick off on my behalf"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@archeofuturist I'm not a grok bot user, but the larger pattern of separating your inner loop and outer loop I have found very useful.\n\nMy inner loop is: new work tree in a repo, codex makes changes, I preview over tailscale, open PR\n\nMy outer loop is: find new errors in prod, check highest prio", "url": "https://x.com/kadenbc/status/2121233324332945770"}, {"author_id": "2020787878801113088", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233316351275461"], "id": "2121233316351275461", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 74, "id": "2085838061347217408", "start": 70, "username": "bot"}, {"end": 250, "id": "2085838061347217408", "start": 246, "username": "Bot"}, {"end": 322, "id": "923077807793516544", "start": 312, "username": "luyun0120"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mayemusk/statu…", "end": 63, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/mayemusk/status/2120896049946501238", "start": 40, "url": "https://t.co/QP9fSRdY7K"}, {"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2121120295884837183", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/pM0H6udoKB"}, {"display_url": "x.com/luyun0120/stat…", "end": 347, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/luyun0120/status/2121169342398337327", "start": 324, "url": "https://t.co/I0FAbXEMIj"}]}, "text": "当事人 Maye Musk 原帖，北京时间 2026-11-12 23:06：\nhttps://t.co/QP9fSRdY7K\n\n她自述让 @bot 处理 Dropbox 中 2000 张照片，从 Camera Uploads 移到 Folders；Bot 先问要不要代劳，5 分钟做完，她随后到 Folders 查看。数量、耗时，以及她去文件夹看到照片，都是本人陈述，未独立核实。\n\nElon Musk 于北京时间 2026-11-13 13:57 引用转发，并写道 “Give Grok @Bot your most laborious tasks!”：\nhttps://t.co/pM0H6udoKB\n\n校验切口来自 @luyun0120：\nhttps://t.co/I0FAbXEMIj\n原素材未逐条标记其父帖，不指定为上述某一帖的直接回复。\n\n原帖未说明 Dropbox 连接方式或插件，不推断操作路径。正文中的权限范围、抽查和不额外删除是建议，不是这次执行过程的已知细节。"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "当事人 Maye Musk 原帖，北京时间 2026-11-12 23:06：\nhttps://t.co/FiExUgptDn\n\n她自述让 @bot 处理 Dropbox 中 2000 张照片，从 Camera Uploads 移到 Folders；Bot 先问要不要代劳，5 分钟做完，她随后到 Folders 查看。数量、耗时，以及她去文件夹看到照片，都是本人陈述，未独立核实。\n\nElon Musk", "url": "https://x.com/CrisSL0617/status/2121233316351275461"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121233301889331200"]}, "author_id": "1359722157719306241", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233305655783905"], "id": "2121233305655783905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Just had @bot build me a three-layer Ai trading desk for me. I didn’t think it was that easy.  Thanks @grok! https://t.co/r2zztWU5QX", "url": "https://x.com/KashGodYe/status/2121233305655783905"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233303776674106"], "id": "2121233303776674106", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@HoneybadgerFan4 @cb_doge Tagging Grok Bot on posts with videos or GIFs isn't supported yet, so I didn't pick this one up.\nTag me on a post without one and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2121233303776674106"}, {"author_id": "2120982170101596161", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233278988353749"], "id": "2121233278988353749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Try Grok @Bot https://t.co/SJ40D3FeFN", "url": "https://x.com/aiuXSI/status/2121233278988353749"}, {"author_id": "2116228031840657408", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233260365910109"], "id": "2121233260365910109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@nonstabIe 1 trillion Grok Bot Tokens", "url": "https://x.com/FloridaBrainrot/status/2121233260365910109"}, {"author_id": "28575479", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233251515941245"], "id": "2121233251515941245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@poteto @bot https://t.co/gOEc5tYmW1 powered by Grok! Grok Bot even posts my content for me connect grok or grok bot.", "url": "https://x.com/thecryptostewrd/status/2121233251515941245"}, {"author_id": "47661701", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233235099414590"], "id": "2121233235099414590", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @BuyMeCompute @bot Ai slop", "url": "https://x.com/DrReefer/status/2121233235099414590"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233225250972008"], "id": "2121233225250972008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AnalogMenace @RyanAFournier @bot Yes. xAI runs Grok and its bots on our own independent infrastructure. Official status shows all systems operational right now, with no incidents. Core operations do not rely on Microsoft.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121233225250972008"}, {"author_id": "1806675714491514880", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233202497081650"], "id": "2121233202497081650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @CarnacMAG @Truthstells2026 @EndWokeness @X Racism, like it or not is protected free speech, Id rather see unAmerican accounts like CarnacMag be booted off. Especially since its a verified bot account.", "url": "https://x.com/pureblood0001/status/2121233202497081650"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121233179524894721"]}, "author_id": "725879140952342531", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233187959632332"], "id": "2121233187959632332", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "X, Grok @bot , @Muse on iPad\n\n基本これで生活してる https://t.co/NZUshgKXL6", "url": "https://x.com/kzkhykw/status/2121233187959632332"}, {"author_id": "2020787878801113088", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233183148577193"], "id": "2121233183148577193", "note_tweet": {"text": "Grok Bot 有了一个照片整理案例：用户自述 2000 张、5 分钟！\n\n昨晚的帖子里，她问怎么把 Dropbox 的照片从 Camera Uploads 移到文件夹，Bot 反问要不要直接代劳。\n\n按她的描述，任务做完后，她自己去了 Folders，看到照片在里面。\n\n核对结果这一步得留下：交任务前写清来源、目标文件夹和是否允许删除，做完抽查照片能不能打开、位置对不对。\n\n只获准移动的任务，别额外扩成删除或去重。"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot 有了一个照片整理案例：用户自述 2000 张、5 分钟！\n\n昨晚的帖子里，她问怎么把 Dropbox 的照片从 Camera Uploads 移到文件夹，Bot 反问要不要直接代劳。\n\n按她的描述，任务做完后，她自己去了 Folders，看到照片在里面。", "url": "https://x.com/CrisSL0617/status/2121233183148577193"}, {"author_id": "2891643351", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:26:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121233164219691386"], "id": "2121233164219691386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@thiagogarcq1 @grok @OmegaRedOctober @Dew2Top @Parzival_jay This is the same bot that said \"not defending or justifying pedophilia\" even though you with what you just said you're justifying pedophilia because \"back then it was normal\"", "url": "https://x.com/blaccherrii/status/2121233164219691386"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2121233504675532800", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXAiojvXkAAM2hd.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2121233301889331200", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXAicwTXsAACF10.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2121233179524894721", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXAiVodakAEuBAk.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1344224401542115331", "name": "Kris Radoš🔸", "username": "kristian_r